    <string name="health_rationale_title">Why TrackMe Calories reads health data</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_body">The app reads your steps, active calories, workouts and workout calories from Health Connect to show them next to what you ate on the Today screen and, if you turn it on, to add part of the calories you burned to that day\'s goal.</string>
    <string name="health_rationale_privacy">The data is only read while the app is open, for the day you\'re viewing. It isn\'t saved, shared or sent anywhere, and the app never writes to Health Connect. You can revoke access at any time in Health Connect.</string>
